  "scope": "Consume only a waiting binding VM; move its actual identity, native return stack, borrowed declaration, remaining meter and limits without callbacks, allocation, cloning, acceptance or dispatch. Initial/final-request/accepted/terminal sessions return unchanged. LocalVm exposes no scope escape. Counter and structured-widget hosts restore after either or both effects; every budget cutoff preserves output, exact invocation/request count and remaining fuel while stale replies and live-policy revocation remain rejected. Existing restoration cleanup/unwind tests now source frames from actual VM polling. This is in-memory ownership transfer, not durable provenance, external-effect cancellation, process-crash settlement or complete graph recovery.",
